gs:\n1. Whether Windows.old really exists and its true size\n2. Check hiberfil.sys / pagefile.sys with Get-Item -Force\n3. Check other major space consumers: user profile directories (AppData, Downloads, etc.)\n\nLet me also check what big directories exist in C:\\ root and user profile. Let me be careful about the sandbox - reading C:\\Windows.old recursively succeeded apparently.\n\nActually, wait. I should double check - maybe the sandbox denied reading and it returned \"无法计算\"? No, it returned 43,637.7 MB, so it did enumerate.\n\nHmm, but hold on. Something seems off: hiberfil.sys and pagefile.sys \"不存在\". With -Force on Test-Path... Test-Path -LiteralPath \"C:\\hiberfil.sys\" should find it if it exists. In a sandbox, maybe root file access is blocked entirely and it returns false? But then Windows.old enumeration would also fail...\n\nActually, Get-ChildItem -Recurse with SilentlyContinue errors would return partial results. If access to Windows.old was denied, size would be 0. It returned 43.6 GB, so enumeration succeeded.\n\nLet me verify pagefile/hiberfil with dir and also check the full C:\\ root listing."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1787561819771,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"发现大头了：**C:\\Windows.old（旧系统备份）占了约 42.6 GB**！另外用户 Temp 有 1.3 GB。再核实一下几个细节（页面文件/休眠文件可能存在但被隐藏）："}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1787561819771,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_NUQB3FGpu8oMeGVebTBm3796","name":"pwsh","arguments":"{\"command\": \"Get-ChildItem C:\\\\ -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object Name, @{N='Type';E={if($_.PSIsContainer){'目录'}else{'文件'}}}, @{N='SizeMB';E={if(-not $_.PSIsContainer){[math]::Round($_.Length/1MB,1)}}} | Format-Table -AutoSize\", \"description\": \"List C drive root including hidden system files\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1787561819771,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":3,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_xp4WvlLquiTklrfDjnay2412","name":"pwsh","argu