eset leftovers (Settings cleanup can remove).\n\nLet me do one more Yarn deletion attempt and a final space check in one command, then finish up with the summary + write a small report file? The user may appreciate a summary. I'll keep summary in chat; optionally write an HTML/TXT report in workspace. Simpler: no file needed, summarize in chat. Actually a reusable cleanup script could be useful for admin tasks. I could write a .cmd/.ps1 that performs the admin steps (hibernation off etc.) for the user to run as admin. Nice touch: provide `清理C盘(管理员).cmd`. Let me create it in the workspace D:\\windoc\\desktop\\3. It should:\n- powercfg /h off\n- cleanmgr (optional) \n- rd Windows.old if exists\n- DISM cleanup\nBut careful about content: hibernation off disables fast startup; ask user preference. I'll include and note.\n\nFirst final attempt + space measure."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935112461,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"剩余 4.8 GB 的 Yarn 缓存是两个 **vue-antd-jeecg 项目离线镜像包**（共 ~5 GB），当前有 35+ 个 node 进程在跑，文件被占用。再试一轮删除并做最终空间统计："}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935112461,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_GLIswnoWVoMX58U0CdyQ6122","name":"pwsh","arguments":"{\"command\": \"$y = \\\"$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\\\Yarn\\\\Cache\\\"\\n$before = ([System.IO.DriveInfo]::GetDrives() | Where-Object Name -eq 'C:\\\\').TotalFreeSpace\\nforeach ($it in (Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $y -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {\\n  try { if ($it.PSIsContainer) { [System.IO.Directory]::Delete($it.FullName, $true) } else { [System.IO.File]::Delete($it.FullName) }; \\\"已删除: $($it.Name)\\\" }\\n  catch { \\\"仍被占用: $($it.Name)\\\" }\\n}\\n$left = (Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $y -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Measure-Object Length -Sum).Sum\\n$after = ([System.IO.DriveInfo]::GetDrives() | Where-Object Name -eq 'C:\\\\').TotalFreeSpace\\n\\\"Yarn缓存剩余: $([math]::Round($left/1MB)) MB\\\"\\n\\\"C盘可用: $([math]