==================","========================","==","=\\n","D","ism",".exe"," /","Online"," /","Clean","up","-","Image"," /","Start","Component","Clean","up","\\n\\n","echo",".\\n","echo"," =","================================","========================","==","=\\n","echo","  ","全部","完成","!"," ","额外","建议",":"," ","运行"," clean","m","gr"," ","勾","选","\\\"","清理","系统","文件","\\\"\\n","echo","  ","本","窗口","可","关闭","\\n","echo"," =","================================","========================","==","=\\n","pause","\\n","\"","}"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139095,"chunk":{"type":"block-start","index":3,"blockType":"tool-call"}},{"type":"tool-call-chunks","time0":1788935139095,"index":3,"dt":[22,0,0,0,1,0,25,1,0,0,37,1,0,0,0,0,12,0,0,0,0,0,26,0,0,0,0,0,9,0,0,0,20,0,0,0,1,0,22,0,1,0,0,0,25,0,0,0,26,0,0,0,2,0,31,0,0,1,0,0,10,0,0,0,1,0,45,0,0,0,0,0,10,0,0,0,1,0,15,0,0,0,1,0,14,0,19,0,0,0,1,0,23,0,1,0,0,0,21,0,1,0,0,0,24,0,0,0,0,0,25,1,18],"id":"call_01_gApvUZrwYGVtZIHmPJ0H6073","name":"todo_write","args":["","{","\"","t","odos","\"",": ","[","{\"","content","\":"," \"","分析"," C"," ","盘","空间","占用","\","," \"","status","\":"," \"","completed","\"},"," {\"","content","\":"," \"","清理","用户"," Temp"," /"," Crash","D","umps","\","," \"","status","\":"," \"","completed","\"},"," {\"","content","\":"," \"","清理"," Y","arn"," /"," pip"," /"," npm"," ","缓存","\","," \"","status","\":"," \"","completed","\"},"," {\"","content","\":"," \"","清理","浏览器","缓存","\","," \"","status","\":"," \"","completed","\"},"," {\"","content","\":"," \"","删除"," HP"," ","驱动","安装","包","残留","\","," \"","status","\":"," \"","completed","\"},"," {\"","content","\":"," \"","验证","释放","空间","并","汇总","报告","\","," \"","status","\":"," \"","completed","\"","}]","}"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139627,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"Yarn cache v6 folder remains locked by active node processes (4,946MB). Everything else cleaned. Final free: 64.21 GB (was 43.47 GB at cleanup start, 49.4GB when I started analysis). So net ~21GB freed during this session's cleanup (plus whatever processes did themselves).\n\nWait, initial analysis said free 49.4GB; cleanup \"before\" said 43.47GB; final 64.21GB. Freed ≈ 20.7–14.8GB depending on baseline. The per-item sums: Yarn ~9.3GB + pip 4.4 + temp 2.1 + npm 1.9 + chrome/edge 0.66 + hp 0.55 + crashdumps 0.12 ≈ 19GB. Rounding & concurrency explain rest. Say \"约 20GB\" safely — from 43.5→64.2 during cleanup = 20.7GB. I'll phrase: C 盘可用从 ~44GB 提升到 ~64GB，净释放约 20GB（另约 4.8GB 因进程占用未能删除）。\n\nNow wrap up: mark todos completed (with note Yarn partial), write summary. Should I also create the admin helper script for the user to run elevated? That would add value for the hiberfil 22.3GB. Let me create a small .cmd in the workspace and mention it. Given the workspace D:\\windoc\\desktop\\3 — writing there is fine.\n\nThe script (run as admin) would:\n- powercfg /h off (free ~22GB) — but disables 快速启动/休眠. Alternatively /type reduced. I'll make the .cmd do: check, offer hibernation off, cleanmgr note, remove $SysReset and Windows.old if exists, DISM /StartComponentCleanup.\n\nActually, careful: a cmd that silently disables hibernation is opinionated. I'll write it to show choices? .cmd interactive prompts are clunky. Better: write a README-like text file? User asked to clean C. I'll present the recommendations in chat and offer to generate the admin script only if they want hibernation off. Simpler: just give the commands in chat; no file clutter. But click-to-run script is friendlier. Given the \"清理\" phrasing and repeated asks, I'll generate one .cmd with clear prompts (choice to skip). Also note fast startup trade-off.\n\nHmm, keep scope tight: I'll create 管理员C盘清理.cmd in workspace that:\n1. powercfg /h off (frees hiberfil ~22GB; disables 快速启动)\n2. rd /s /q C:\\Windows.old if exists\n3. rd /s /q C:\\$SysReset.bak? no — $SysReset: do not remove blindly. Skip.\n4. cleanmgr /sagerun note? cleanmgr GUI opens; fine mention.\n5. DISM /Online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup\n\nI'll include echo guidance in Chinese. Note: user must right-click → 以管理员身份运行.\n\nLet me write the file with proper encoding (cmd with Chinese needs GBK or use chcp 65001 + UTF8 BOM). PowerShell writing UTF-8 with BOM: cmd reads BOM fine with chcp 65001? Actually cmd.exe handles UTF-8 BOM poorly at times; classic trick: write file as ANSI/GBK, or use chcp 65001 as first line and UTF-8 without BOM... cmd parses the file bytes with current codepage; with chcp 65001 set inside the file, earlier lines already parsed. Common approach: write .cmd in GBK (System default on Chinese Windows = GBK/936). To avoid mojibake risk, safest: keep .cmd messages in English+pinyin? Ugly. Alternative: provide a PowerShell .ps1 with UTF-8 BOM run via right-click \"使用 PowerShell 运行\" — execution policy may block. Simplest robust: write .cmd with `chcp 65001 >nul` on first line and encode entire file as UTF-8 (no BOM). cmd: after chcp 65001, subsequent lines are read with UTF-8? The codepage affects how cmd displays, but the file is read line by line and decoded using console CP at parse time... For .cmd files, cmd reads bytes and interprets according to current OEM CP unless chcp changed earlier — lines after chcp 65001 are decoded as UTF-8 in practice (this works generally). It's commonly done and works on Win10+. I'll do: first line @echo off, second chcp 65001>nul, then UTF-8 (no BOM) content. Wait actually decoding happens at parse: cmd buffers the entire batch? It reads incrementally, so changing codepage mid-file does affect subsequent parsing in modern Windows. Widely used pattern; acceptable.\n\nHmm — but writing non-BOM UTF-8: the write tool writes UTF-8 text presumably without BOM. Chinese chars in there decoded per 65001 after chcp → OK.\n\nAlternatively skip Chinese in cmd and keep it ASCII with comments in English, and explain in chat. Risk-free. I'll add minimal Chinese-safe? Let's keep the cmd lean with Chinese via chcp 65001 approach but also guard: if not admin, it re-launches itself elevated via powershell Start-Process -Verb RunAs. Nice UX.\n\nContent plan:\n```\n@echo off\nchcp 65001 >nul\ntitle C盘深度清理(需要管理员)\n:: 自动提权\nnet session >nul 2>&1 || (powershell -NoProfile -Command \"Start-Process -FilePath '%~f0' -Verb RunAs\" & exit /b)\n\necho === 1/3 关闭休眠, 删除休眠文件(约可释放 22GB) ===\necho 注意: 会同时关闭\"快速启动\"和\"休眠\"功能\npowercfg /h off\nif exist C:\\hiberfil.sys (echo 休眠文件仍存在, 请重启后自动删除) else (echo 休眠文件已删除/已标记删除)\n\necho === 2/3 清理旧系统 Windows.old ===\nif exist \"C:\\Windows.old\" ( takeown /F \"C:\\Windows.old\" /R /A /D Y >nul 2>&1 & icacls \"C:\\Windows.old\" /grant Administrators:F /T /Q >nul 2>&1 & rd /s /q \"C:\\Windows.old\" & echo Windows.old 已删除 ) else (echo 未发现 Windows.old)\n\necho === 3/3 组件存储清理(DISM) ===\nDism.exe /Online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup\n\necho === 完成 ===\necho 可再运行 cleanmgr(磁盘清理) 选择\"清理系统文件\"\npause\n```\nCareful: auto-elevation & exit logic. net session works when admin. Good.\n\nNote: `rd /s /q C:\\Windows.old` after takeown — Windows.old doesn't exist per our view, so it'll skip — fine, defensive.\n\nI'll name it something ASCII-safe: `C盘清理-管理员.cmd`. Chinese filename may cause issues; ASCII name better: `cleanup_C_admin.cmd`.\n\nWrite file, mark todos, final summary. Also confirm final free space number for the summary (64.21GB) and list leftover items needing admin:\n- hiberfil.sys 22.3GB — via the cmd (powercfg /h off), frees ~22GB + needs reboot for actual file removal? powercfg /h off deletes hiberfil.sys immediately (no reboot needed usually).\n- Yarn 4.8GB locked by node processes — close node/dev tools & rerun, or I can retry later.\n- JetBrains 9.2GB — manual/optional (IDE caches; can invalidate). Actually maybe user uses Toolbox with many IDEs. Suggest optional.\n- $SysReset 181MB, ProgramData 2.7GB deep-cleanable portions — minor.\n- Also DISM component cleanup may free several GB (WinSxS) — included in cmd.\n\nWrite cmd file now."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139627,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"剩余 4.8 GB Yarn 缓存确实被 node 进程锁定，暂无法删除。清理已基本完成。最后生成一个**管理员清理脚本**给你处理需要管理员权限的部分（休眠文件 22GB、组件存储等）："}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139627,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_T0wwGn22HgZO4NStBWcx6355","name":"write","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"D:\\\\windoc\\\\desktop\\\\3\\\\cleanup_C_admin.cmd\", \"content\": \"@echo off\\nchcp 65001 >nul\\ntitle C盘深度清理(管理员) - 预计可再释放 20GB 以上\\n\\n:: ---- 自动请求管理员权限 ----\\nnet session >nul 2>&1\\nif %errorlevel% neq 0 (\\n    echo 正在请求管理员权限...\\n    powershell -NoProfile -Command \\\"Start-Process -FilePath '%~f0' -Verb RunAs\\\"\\n    exit /b\\n)\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  [1/3] 关闭休眠并删除休眠文件 hiberfil.sys ^(约释放 22GB^)\\necho  注意: 会同时关闭\\\"休眠\\\"和\\\"快速启动\\\"功能, 如需保留请按 N\\necho ============================================================\\necho.\\nchoice /C YN /M \\\"是否关闭休眠并删除休眠文件\\\"\\nif %errorlevel% equ 1 (\\n    powercfg /h off\\n    if exist C:\\\\hiberfil.sys (\\n        echo [!] hiberfil.sys 仍在, 重启电脑后会自动消失\\n    ) else (\\n        echo [OK] 休眠已关闭, hiberfil.sys 已释放\\n    )\\n) else (\\n    echo [跳过] 保留休眠功能\\n)\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  [2/3] 删除旧系统备份 Windows.old ^(若存在^)\\necho ============================================================\\nif exist \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" (\\n    takeown /F \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" /R /A /D Y >nul 2>&1\\n    icacls \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" /grant Administrators:F /T /Q >nul 2>&1\\n    rd /s /q \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\"\\n    if exist \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" (echo [!] 部分文件被占用, 重启后再试) else (echo [OK] Windows.old 已删除)\\n) else (\\n    echo [跳过] 未发现 Windows.old\\n)\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  [3/3] Windows 组件存储清理 ^(WinSxS, 视情况释放数GB^)\\necho ============================================================\\nDism.exe /Online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  全部完成! 额外建议: 运行 cleanmgr 勾选\\\"清理系统文件\\\"\\necho  本窗口可关闭\\necho ============================================================\\npause\\n\"}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139627,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":3,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_gApvUZrwYGVtZIHmPJ0H6073","name":"todo_write","arguments":"{\"todos\": [{\"content\": \"分析 C 盘空间占用\", \"status\": \"completed\"}, {\"content\": \"清理用户 Temp / CrashDumps\", \"status\": \"completed\"}, {\"content\": \"清理 Yarn / pip / npm 缓存\", \"status\": \"completed\"}, {\"content\": \"清理浏览器缓存\", \"status\": \"completed\"}, {\"content\": \"删除 HP 驱动安装包残留\", \"status\": \"completed\"}, {\"content\": \"验证释放空间并汇总报告\", \"status\": \"completed\"}]}"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139628,"chunk":{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":121,"outputTokens":2579,"totalTokens":42124,"cacheReadTokens":39424,"reasoningTokens":1783}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788935139628,"chunk":{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"}}}]},"surfaceOp":"append"}
{"type":"tool/call","seq":169,"time":1788935139632,"data":{"turn":2,"step":17,"callId":"call_00_T0wwGn22HgZO4NStBWcx6355","name":"write","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"D:\\\\windoc\\\\desktop\\\\3\\\\cleanup_C_admin.cmd\", \"content\": \"@echo off\\nchcp 65001 >nul\\ntitle C盘深度清理(管理员) - 预计可再释放 20GB 以上\\n\\n:: ---- 自动请求管理员权限 ----\\nnet session >nul 2>&1\\nif %errorlevel% neq 0 (\\n    echo 正在请求管理员权限...\\n    powershell -NoProfile -Command \\\"Start-Process -FilePath '%~f0' -Verb RunAs\\\"\\n    exit /b\\n)\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  [1/3] 关闭休眠并删除休眠文件 hiberfil.sys ^(约释放 22GB^)\\necho  注意: 会同时关闭\\\"休眠\\\"和\\\"快速启动\\\"功能, 如需保留请按 N\\necho ============================================================\\necho.\\nchoice /C YN /M \\\"是否关闭休眠并删除休眠文件\\\"\\nif %errorlevel% equ 1 (\\n    powercfg /h off\\n    if exist C:\\\\hiberfil.sys (\\n        echo [!] hiberfil.sys 仍在, 重启电脑后会自动消失\\n    ) else (\\n        echo [OK] 休眠已关闭, hiberfil.sys 已释放\\n    )\\n) else (\\n    echo [跳过] 保留休眠功能\\n)\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  [2/3] 删除旧系统备份 Windows.old ^(若存在^)\\necho ============================================================\\nif exist \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" (\\n    takeown /F \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" /R /A /D Y >nul 2>&1\\n    icacls \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" /grant Administrators:F /T /Q >nul 2>&1\\n    rd /s /q \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\"\\n    if exist \\\"C:\\\\Windows.old\\\" (echo [!] 部分文件被占用, 重启后再试) else (echo [OK] Windows.old 已删除)\\n) else (\\n    echo [跳过] 未发现 Windows.old\\n)\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  [3/3] Windows 组件存储清理 ^(WinSxS, 视情况释放数GB^)\\necho ============================================================\\nDism.exe /Online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup\\n\\necho.\\necho ============================================================\\necho  全部完成! 额外建议: 运行 cleanmgr 勾选\\\"清理系统文件\\\"\\necho  本窗口可关闭\\necho ============================================================\\npause\\n\"}"}}
